Tougher (Extra Hard Mode Fabric 26.3 port)
==========================================

This project is a greenfield Fabric reimplementation of Extra Hard Mode,
shipped as Tougher for Minecraft Java 26.3. It is licensed under GNU AGPL
v3.0 or later (SPDX: AGPL-3.0-or-later).

It is not a copy of the original `com.extrahardmode.*` Java sources.
The Java package remains `dev.extrahardmode`; the public mod id is `tougher`.

